WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:08,050
As for now, I have to venture out and search the empty rooms in the building.

2
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:10,250
See if you can find any useful supplies

3
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:12,780
Even if you find a pillow to prepare, it will be fine

4
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:14,980
Find a place to go to the toilet by the way

5
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:24,400
Nothing was found

6
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:27,480
Uncle Xu's team rugs were completely scraped clean.

7
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:30,050
No way, I need to find a toilet first

8
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:32,050
These empty rooms don't even have a door.

9
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:34,050
People passing by can see it at a glance

10
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:35,550
I can only go downstairs to find a place.

11
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:43,600
Do we really want to leave the community?

12
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,600
Is it too dangerous?

13
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:47,620
There is definitely a danger, but the building has insufficient resources.

14
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:49,620
We can observe other teams first

15
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:51,620
If they can come back safely

16
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:53,620
Let's go out again
